	| Project Name          | Provis - ${staticProjectName}     |
	| Code                  | VISPROPROVIS                      |
	| Partner               | Propar - ${staticCompanyName}     |
	| Addresses             | Rua Visconde de Porto Seguro 1238 |
	| Addresses             | Brazil                            |
	| Addresses             | Sao Paulo                         |
	| Addresses             | São Paulo                         |
	| Addresses             | 04642-000                         |
